  "details": "Allow PCVR players to use hand tracking via OSC, would allow quest/pico hand tracking potentially via ALXR/Virtual Desktop or Ultraleap devices to be used. (also hand tracking gloves without having to emulate index controllers)\n\nI'd suggest the following adresses\n\n/tracking/hand/leftposhmd\n\n/tracking/hand/leftrothmd\n\n/tracking/hand/rightposhmd\n\n/tracking/hand/rightrothmd\n\n/tracking/hand/leftposplayspace\n\n/tracking/hand/leftrotplayspace\n\n/tracking/hand/rightposplayspace\n\n/tracking/hand/rightrotplayspace\n\n/tracking/hand/leftthumb\n\n/tracking/hand/leftindex\n\n/tracking/hand/leftmiddle\n\n/tracking/hand/leftring\n\n/tracking/hand/leftpinky\n\n/tracking/hand/rightthumb\n\n/tracking/hand/rightindex\n\n/tracking/hand/rightmiddle\n\n/tracking/hand/rightring\n\n/tracking/hand/rightpinky\n\nfingers would be formatted as 4 floats per adress (siumlar to /tracking/eye/LeftRightPitchYaw), with the first 3 being curl and the 4th being splay",
